OL,3,GNEWSAAllergies leave blind woman
OL,4,Awithout guide dog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman says she fears for her blind
OL,7,Fmother's safety after family pet
OL,8,Fallergies prevented her from getting a
OL,9,Fnew guide dog.
OL,11,FCarly Watson said her mother Isabel
OL,12,FHoldsworth had relied on guide dogs for
OL,13,F40 years, but has been without one
OL,14,Fsince her last dog retired.
OL,16,FIsabel, who is also hearing impaired,
OL,17,Fsaid she no longer felt safe going out
OL,18,Falone, having recently suffered a
OL,19,Fbroken rib in a fall and been involved
OL,20,Fin a crash with an electric car.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
