OL,3,GNEWSAAllergies leave blind woman
OL,4,Awithout guide dog
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity Guide Dogs said no breed
OL,7,Fwas 100% hypoallergenic and it offered
OL,8,Falternative support where its guide dog
OL,9,Fservice was not suitable.
